"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QD9y9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T11:35:11Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T11:35:11Z","body":"I'm not aware of anyone working on it, please go ahead!","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3490700477/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3492957128","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112331#issuecomment-3492957128","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112331","id":3492957128,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QMkvI","user":{"login":"cabranca","id":83430448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDMwNDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83430448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca","html_url":"https://github.com/cabranca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T19:28:16Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T19:28:16Z","body":"I've been working on this issue yesterday. I've found out that the \"bug\" is due to this change on the error handling when a conversion is attempted from a non-instantiated material: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/109369.\n\nI have a few questions in order to know what'd be the best approach.\n\n- Before the conversion didn't check material instantiation and now it does. I suppose this is fine, is it?\n- As the conversion fails, a null pointer is returned and therefore the sky_material is set to null (disappears in the editor). What would be the expected result? To convert it to ShaderMaterial anyway? to leave the sky_material? Other option?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3492957128/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493782544","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112331#issuecomment-3493782544","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112331","id":3493782544,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QPuQQ","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T22:15:25Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T22:15:25Z","body":"> Before the conversion didn't check material instantiation and now it does. I suppose this is fine, is it?\n\nI'm not sure I understand this question. But checks are usually good.\n\n> As the conversion fails, a null pointer is returned and therefore the sky_material is set to null (disappears in the editor). What would be the expected result? To convert it to ShaderMaterial anyway? to leave the sky_material? Other option?\n\nI would expect the conversion not to fail. This is why I opened this issue.\n\nIf the conversion does fail (for example, due to a new, future bug), I would expect the `sky_material` not to be set to `null`, but to keep its current value.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493782544/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493918179","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/112331#issuecomment-3493918179","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112331","id":3493918179,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7QQPXj","user":{"login":"cabranca","id":83430448,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgzNDMwNDQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/83430448?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca","html_url":"https://github.com/cabranca","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cabranca/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-05T22:44:27Z","updated_at":"2025-11-05T22:45:55Z","body":"Sorry for the confusion. I'm new to Godot so I'm not sure about some guidelines, decisions, etc. What I meant with my question is that the check might have been too restrictive. Maybe it wasn't supposed to check the instantiation for the sky_materials. As far as I know, the Sky Material is never instantiated in the inspector.\n\nSo I see at least these solutions:\n\n- Make exceptions for sky_materiales to be allow conversions without instantiation (I suppose this is not a good choice).\n- Keep the sky_material when the conversion returns null (only for sky_materials or for every material from the editor resource picker).\n\nFeel free to correct what I say, as I mentioned I'm a rookie in this project :)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3493918179/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]